{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f9060b978a98befee669c658bf7b49561328d9d220f6bf0641d7f3833430bf88", "ja": "（今日は真美のPV撮影日だ。恋がテーマの歌だから、\n内容もそれに沿ったものとなっているが……）", "zh": "（今天是真美拍摄PV的日子。因为是以恋爱为主题的歌曲，所以内容也与之相符，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "eb1369231446bc579b6f06cd6ffbf36e8244dbcc43eed45f6d423b4eb933e398", "ja": "兄ちゃん。恋ってなんなのかな。\n愛って、一体なんなんだろうね……。", "zh": "哥哥。恋爱究竟是什么呢？\n爱，到底又是什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1002_p", "source_sha256": "814951af8891d2d2e175c893418ab89b07359b65316b7bec58154d572e550754", "ja": "……急に深い事を言い出したな。\nなんだ、珍しく悩んでるのか？", "zh": "……突然说起深奥的话题来了啊。\n怎么，难得见你在烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "0e2da0e503a4dfc2d028684475858b6591b344f786603d9ac99bd8c5928c1d2a", "ja": "だってさ、真美、コクハクとかしたことないもん。\nラブレター渡す役とか言われても、わかんないよ～……", "zh": "因为真美从来没告白过嘛。就算让我演递情书的人，我也不知道该怎么办啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "f66669143b341b487b791dafb181ead698a71501ee840632dcb8ce2aa3d1877f", "ja": "ってことで、まずは経験！　今から兄ちゃんにコクハク\nするね！　いい感じに返事してちょ！　よろよろ～♪", "zh": "所以说，首先得积累经验！现在就向哥哥告白！要好好回应我哦！拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "20aea00763eae45a1827163409472d64b7dbc41500144ddd9c5598c21bbefa4e", "ja": "ええっ！？　い、いきなりだな……\nまあ、それで何かつかめるなら協力はするけど。", "zh": "诶！？也、也太突然了吧……  \n不过，要是这样能有所收获，我就帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "35a72924954b4f41de521d3d224c2cbc8d7683014d895911165a3ce9c1f60da0", "ja": "兄ちゃんは憧れの先輩って設定ね！\n真美は、そんな先輩に恋する美少女の後輩ちゃん！", "zh": "哥哥的设定是令人憧憬的前辈！\n真美则是爱上了那位前辈的美少女后辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "7a2f36cd088bbc662b9d326173d7a58dfece9e339e3cf968444c3f8f99e439ea", "ja": "そんでそんで、舞台は放課後。\n先輩を呼び出して、ラブレターを渡すシーンだよ！", "zh": "然后然后，舞台设定在放学后。\n这是叫出学长，向他递情书的场景哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e7774f42c03f5a2c0c61170254e8fa748ae05af182a77c511fe8bd0fcd87c47a", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\n……あまり演技には期待するなよ？", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n……别对我的演技抱太大期待啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "3257b0276a4152b829dbeab4727f3275e3393fc0bfdab2bea5c6b06b43918739", "ja": "はーい！　それじゃ本番……アクション！\n……あ、あの。兄ちゃん先輩。", "zh": "好——！那就正式开始……Action！\n……那、那个。哥哥前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "3344659838e989fa6e3ce2c7b4aa9f9dcb3bd2014a1b1f90ad8f4cae8ea4fa1f", "ja": "真美、初めて会った時から兄ちゃん先輩のことが……。\nす、す……す……あれ？　す……すぅぅぅ……", "zh": "真美，从第一次见到哥哥前辈开始，就对哥哥前辈……  \n喜、喜……喜……咦？喜……喜呜呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "cefa242eb5bed9e9471dd035b608c7a55c92cf34162486bf622ee5ef451d104c", "ja": "す　き　焼　き　拳　！　アチョ～！！！！", "zh": "寿　喜　烧　拳！呀哈——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "537f7ea63be6b9f1467018a40ae3905c70536279c408050ee64f59c2607262e2", "ja": "うわっ、危なっ！？\nな、なんで殴りかかってくるんだ！", "zh": "哇啊，好险！？\n你、你怎么突然挥拳打过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "c4d30c9aa038c325e5c7447a2ae1f0ede7df75023adb3df4b91857fe5fd3647f", "ja": "はっ！　ご、ゴメン、兄ちゃん！\nなんか真美、すき焼き拳の使い手になっちゃった……。", "zh": "哈！对、对不起，哥哥！\n真美好像变成寿喜烧拳的使用者了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "24055136f93f9c838fb05acadf3e9f70afbc59191a64efa2de1c2cf23a2a1653", "ja": "後輩ちゃんになって、兄ちゃん先輩に\n告白するんだ～って思ったらなんかこう……", "zh": "一想到真美变成后辈，向学长哥哥\n告白什么的～不知怎么就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "280c5b0040b270e00e03b9cd1cb706355f8ad11df49264e2e6228f8c9fb1a690", "ja": "こう～……って、やっぱ何でもない！\nとりあえず秘密特訓はこれにて終了ってことで！", "zh": "就是这样～……算了，没什么！\n总之，秘密特训就到此结束啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "04d5a942630b3143446948a4a8ab938c6ac808c1e73bd7056f3878bf80d89f6b", "ja": "あ、ああ。真美がそれでいいならいいけど。\nでも、本当に続けなくて大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊，啊。真美觉得这样就行的话，那就行。\n不过，真的不用继续了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "f58a447c7c0eecd2b4692168b678c37457c5e0381b896f184f0051ac365daec6", "ja": "大丈夫、大丈夫！\n真美、本番に強い子っぽいよー！", "zh": "没问题，没问题！\n真美感觉像是那种在正式场合特别吃得开的孩子哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "d2a81b3db755a5958f1bcded916ca8d466d475f43634e2fdd6d559128f4d0488", "ja": "それに……なんとなーく、\n役の感じ、わかったような気もするし……？", "zh": "而且……总觉得，\n好像也有点明白这个角色该怎么演了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0264_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "2677a18928d3e98519e7a1e4316941c423952cc7ad84140a7c3eba8294d87ab3", "ja": "それじゃ、兄ちゃん。真美、撮影行ってくんね！\n練習の成果バッチシ見せるから、期待してていいよ♪", "zh": "那哥哥，真美去拍摄啦！  \n会把练习的成果完美展现给你看的，尽管期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
